Example: is_woodall(383) returns True.', 'def is_woodall(x):
    pass
', 'def is_woodall(x): 
	if (x % 2 == 0): 
		return False
	if (x == 1): 
		return True
	x = x + 1 
	p = 0
	while (x % 2 == 0): 
		x = x/2
		p = p + 1
		if (p == x): 
			return True
	return False
', 'Confirm the example: is_woodall(383) returns True. Ask about empty, repeated, or boundary inputs before coding.', 'Ask the candidate to trace the first visible example by hand and state the rule they applied before changing code.', 'is_woodall', '{"arguments":"positional JSON arguments","return":"JSON-serializable return value","comparison":"exact JSON equality"}'::jsonb, false);
