Example: sort_numeric_strings([''4'', ''12'', ''45'', ''7'', ''0'', ''100'', ''200'', ''-12'', ''-500'']) returns [-500, -12, 0, 4, 7, 12, 45, 100, 200].', 'def sort_numeric_strings(nums_str):
